DESCRIPTION >
    Identifier-level first and last observation timestamps from the same completed
    BigQuery generation as the identity-state seed.

SCHEMA >
    `identifier_key` String `json:$.identifier_key`,
    `first_seen_at` DateTime64(6) `json:$.first_seen_at`,
    `last_seen_at` DateTime64(6) `json:$.last_seen_at`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY identifier_key

IMPORT_CONNECTION_NAME boom_bigquery_gcs
IMPORT_BUCKET_URI gs://booming-data/tinybird/migration_seed/identity_mapping_evidence/snapshot_at=20260826230500/*.parquet
IMPORT_SCHEDULE @on-demand
IMPORT_FORMAT parquet
